WEBVTT

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.730
Their hearts are certainly
connected by a deep bond.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.530
A strong, true bond between
master and servant.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:16.530
But chains of sadness
now restrict them both.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:24.040
Pain from the distant and recent pasts,
disguising itself as cold reality.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:29.130
The magic I hold gives me the power
to break through sadness and tears.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.590
I'll definitely save you both.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.590
So please, don't cry anymore.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.180
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical
Nanoha A's will now begin.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.010
Huh? We're at school...?

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.430
You're right...

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.610
Amy-san!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.070
Verifying current situation!

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:05.620
Fate-chan's vital signs are still there!

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:10.000
She's simply been trapped
within the Book of Darkness!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.630
I'm currently formulating
a way to rescue her!

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:25.220
My master and that girl will never
awaken from their endless dreams.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:30.440
Dreams that lie between life
and death... they are eternal.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.440
Nothing is eternal.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:40.950
Everyone changes.
They have to!

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.450
I have to... and so do you!

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:27.120
This place is...

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:34.000
Fate, Alicia, Arf, it's time to wake up!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.040
It couldn't be...

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.260
Good morning, Fate.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.550
Are you up and at 'em?

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.970
Yup!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.480
I'm still sleepy...

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:55.600
You two stayed up late again, didn't you?

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.020
Just a little!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:57.810
Yeah!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:01.940
You should take after Fate a little...
Early to bed, early to rise.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:04.070
You are her older sister after all, Alicia!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.240
Umm...

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.240
Rynith...?

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.250
Yes, what is it, Fate?

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.250
Alicia...

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:31.640
I may have spoken too soon.
Fate's also a sleepyhead this morning.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:36.440
Now, go get changed.
It's time for breakfast.

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.520
Presea's already down
in the dining room.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.020
Okay!

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.030
Mother...

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.490
Mother! Good morning!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.200
Good morning, Presea!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.710
Alicia, Arf, good morning.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:04.300
Presea... I have some bad news.
It might rain or even snow today...

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:09.010
Come on, Fate.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.730
Fate, what's the matter?

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:21.980
From what I can tell,
she had a nightmare,

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.980
and thinks that this is all
just a dream or illusion.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:27.610
Fate, are you sure you didn't
study too much yesterday?

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:28.490
I could see that!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:31.490
Fate, come on.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:54.470
You must've had a really scary dream,
but everything's all right now.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:58.560
Rynith, Alicia, and I...
We're all here with you now.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.060
Presea, I'm here, too!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.770
Oh, that's right.
Arf's here, too.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:11.070
By the time you finish breakfast,
that scary dream will have faded away.

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:13.950
Now then, why don't we all sit down?

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.080
Okay!

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:36.100
<i>This is all wrong...
This is just a dream.</i>

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:43.350
<i>Mother never smiled at
me like that... not once...</i>

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:48.110
<i>And Alicia and Rynith are both... gone...</i>

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:54.120
<i>But this is...</i>

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:57.450
Hey, why don't we all
go into town today?

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.500
That sounds nice!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:03.170
After all, I do need to buy
Fate a new pair of shoes!

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.880
Ah, no fair!
It's always Fate!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.630
It's her reward for getting a
perfect score on her magic test.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.260
You need to try a bit harder, Alicia.

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.590
Yeah!

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:18.560
Fate! I'm counting on you to
tutor me for the next exam!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.020
Y-Yeah...

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.560
Fate...?

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:31.570
<i>This is what...
I've always wanted...</i>

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:32.950
<i>I've had this dream so many times...</i>

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:33.990
Fate...

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.950
What's wrong, Fate?

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.580
Fate.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.490
<i>I'm so tired...</i>

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:44.790
<i>So, so tired...</i>

00:08:55.890 --> 00:09:00.060
Please go to sleep, my master.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.930
I will grant all your wishes.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:08.520
Please close your eyes
and dream peacefully.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.000
Schwarzer Wirkung.

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:55.360
<i>Lindy-san, Amy-san, I've moved
the battle to over the sea.</i>

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.660
<i>Please take care of the
fires within the city!</i>

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:01.910
Don't worry. I've already dispatched
our disaster relief team!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:04.790
<i>And Book of Darkness-san
is kind of a whiny brat,</i>

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:06.790
<i>but I think I can get through to her!</i>

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.790
<i>Please let me continue a little longer!</i>

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.790
Let's do this, Raising Heart!

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.420
Yes, my master.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.090
The relief team has arrived.
They're beginning to extinguish the flames.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:21.100
I guess this wouldn't be the best time
to ask her to restrain herself.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:23.850
Reload.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:27.180
Three magazines and
eighteen cartridges left...

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:30.860
I wonder if I'll have a chance
to fire Starlight Breaker...

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:32.860
I have a method.
I have a method.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.150
Call me to "Excelion Mode."

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.490
I can't do that!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:40.870
I was told not to use that until
your main body was reinforced!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:45.740
If I don't control it properly,
you'll be destroyed!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.660
Call me.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.420
Call me, my master.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:59.260
<i>What... did I wish for again...?</i>

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:01.720
To dream.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:05.390
To turn a tragic reality into a dream.

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.060
Please dream in peace.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:11.690
<i>Is that... so?</i>

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:32.880
My... true... wish...

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:36.000
You shall also go to sleep.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.710
I will, eventually.

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:39.670
But not right now!

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:43.470
Right now, I'm going to save
Hayate-chan and Fate-chan!

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.220
And you, as well!

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:49.930
Raising Heart!
Excelion Mode!

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:51.270
Drive...

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.150
Ignition.

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:10.450
I'll end this cycle of
nightmares and tragedies!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.460
Photon Lancer, Genocide Shift.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.160
Huh...?

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.410
It looks like a storm's coming.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.410
Fate, let's go back.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.290
Fate!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:01.420
I'm sorry, Alicia...
I'm going to stay here a little longer.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:04.170
Really?

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.930
Then I'll stay, too!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.300
Together with you...

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.350
taking shelter from the rain!

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.400
Hey, Alicia...

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.780
This is a dream, isn't it?

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:34.120
The two of us can't be
in the same world...

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:37.750
If you were still alive,
I wouldn't have been born.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.750
I... guess so...

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:44.760
Mother was never this kind to me...

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.720
She was a really kind person.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.640
Because she was so kind, she broke...

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:55.270
while trying to revive me after I died...

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:57.480
Yeah...

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:04.650
Hey, Fate...
isn't a dream good enough?

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:09.280
Let's stay here...
together, forever.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:13.160
I can live, as long as we stay in here.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.580
I can stay here as your older sister.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:21.590
You can be with Mother, Arf,
and Rynith... with everyone!

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:27.090
We'll give you all the
happiness you wished for.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:32.100
The happiness I wished for was...

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.970
A healthy body.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:39.350
To keep living with those you love.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.360
Please go to sleep.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:46.860
That way, you can live in a
dream world like that forever.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.410
Yes, but...

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.040
that's just a dream.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:09.680
You actually think a bombardment
attack I know will hit me?

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.260
I'll defeat you!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.720
Raising Heart is giving me all of her power!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.430
With her life and heart on the line,
she's answering my call!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.940
To save this crying girl!

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:24.440
A.C.S. Standby.

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.450
Accel Charger, activate...

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.070
Strike Flame!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.410
Open.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.040
Excelion Buster A.C.S.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:40.910
Drive!

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:52.720
Reach her!

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.020
Break...

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:01.850
It can't be...

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.600
...Shoot!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:21.210
<i>Basically point-blank...</i>

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:25.080
<i>A direct hit from Excelion Buster
after destroying her barrier...</i>

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.540
<i>If that didn't work, then...</i>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.050
Master!

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:35.550
Looks like we need to
give it just a little more!

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.300
Yes.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:40.890
I didn't wish for this.

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.810
You should feel the same way!

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.310
Am I wrong?

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:49.400
My heart is deeply
linked with the knights.

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:54.320
Which is why, like the
knights, I hold you dear.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:17:00.080
And that's why I can't forgive myself
for being the one who's killing you...

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:04.870
I can't stop my power,
which is going out of control...

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.040
I can't stop it from
eating into your body...

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:11.460
I can't stop the you outside
who's also gone out of control.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:17.970
When the true awakening happened,
I sort of learned what's been going on.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:22.980
The sadness of being unable
to live the way you want to...

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:27.150
I can also understand some of that.
You're the same as Signum and the others!

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:30.190
You've been sad and lonely for so long...

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.110
Yes...

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:35.200
But don't forget.

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.700
Right now, I am your master!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.200
You have to listen to
what your master says.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.000
I'm sorry, Alicia...

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:53.010
But... I have to go now.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:54.420
I see...

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:19.530
Thank you, and... I'm sorry, Alicia...

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:24.330
It's all right.
After all, I'm your big sister.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:28.670
Your strong and gentle friends
are waiting for you, right?

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.830
Yeah...

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:33.920
Then, take care, Fate...

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:34.590
Yeah...

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:39.890
I wish I could've been with
you like this in reality, too...

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:50.060
I'll give you a name.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.230
I won't let anyone call you the "Book of Darkness"

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.400
or the "Cursed Tome" any longer.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.860
I won't let them!

00:18:57.610 --> 00:19:02.070
I'm your administrator.
I can do this.

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.830
It's impossible...

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.830
The automatic defense
program won't stop...

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:09.620
That mage from the Administrative
Bureau is fighting against it...

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:10.330
but she'll also...

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.330
Stop.

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.970
<i>You out there!</i>

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.800
<i>Umm... you from the
Administrative Bureau!</i>

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:27.470
<i>I'm... umm... the guardian of the girl
in front of you right now, Yagami Hayate!</i>

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.600
Hayate-chan?!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.270
<i>N-Nanoha-chan?!
Is that really you?</i>

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:35.860
It's me! So much has happened, and I'm
fighting against Book of Darkness-san!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:42.240
<i>I'm sorry, Nanoha-chan...
Could you please do your best to stop her?</i>

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:47.290
<i>I've taken control away
from the tome itself...</i>

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:51.250
<i>but I can't use my administrator
powers the way she is now!</i>

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:55.380
<i>The automatic defense program
is out there right now!</i>

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:01.340
<i>After the Book of Darkness reached
completion, the administrator woke up?</i>

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.930
<i>Then...</i>

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:04.050
Nanoha!

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.970
I'll put this as simply as I can!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.060
If you can do what I'm about to say,

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.810
Hayate-chan and Fate
should be able to break out!

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:11.810
Okay!

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:16.570
I don't care how, but hit her with
as much magical damage as you can!

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:19.070
All of your power!
Don't hold back!

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:23.070
That's what I like to hear, Yuuno-kun!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.030
Easy to understand!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:27.330
It's so.
It's so.

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.710
Excelion Buster, Barrel Expansion!

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:38.170
Mid-range Firing Mode!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:40.670
All right. Barrel Shot.

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:59.440
In the name of the Master of the Night Sky,
I grant you a new name.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:05.240
For one so strong and supportive.
The blessed wind who protects us all.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.070
Reinforce.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.750
Bardiche, it's time to leave.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.460
Can you change into Zanber Form?

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.130
Yes, sir.

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:20.090
That's a good boy.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.090
Zanber Form.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.570
Hurricane Thunderclap!

00:21:57.870 --> 00:22:00.670
Excelion Buster, Force Burst!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.890
Sprite Zanber!

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:20.400
Break Shoot!

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:31.570
"Reinforce" recognized as new name.

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:35.660
Administrator powers have been enabled.

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:38.160
<i>Right...</i>

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:46.920
Fate!

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:53.260
However, I cannot stop the defense
program from going out of control.

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:57.980
The power that was separated from
my control will rampage shortly.

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:00.230
Don't worry.
We'll do something about it.

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:04.440
Shall we go, Reinforce?

00:23:04.440 --> 00:23:06.650
Yes, my master.

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:12.910
Everyone, be careful!

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:15.450
I'm still getting a signal from the Book!

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.200
Here's where the real battle starts...

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:19.710
Chrono, are you prepared?

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:20.920
Yes!

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:22.250
I'm about to arrive on the scene!

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:26.760
The Arc-en-ciel...

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:31.010
I hope we can finish this
without having to use it.

00:25:10.610 --> 00:25:14.860
The automatic defense program that broke
its connection with the tome goes berserk.

00:25:14.860 --> 00:25:18.370
We of the Administrative Bureau
stand against it, as do...

00:25:18.370 --> 00:25:20.580
And... and...!

00:25:20.580 --> 00:25:24.790
This will surely be the final battle in
the entire Book of Darkness case.

00:25:24.790 --> 00:25:27.750
Next time on
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha A's:

00:25:27.750 --> 00:25:29.040
Episode 12:

00:25:29.040 --> 00:25:31.000
Evening's End, Journey's End.

00:25:31.710 --> 00:25:34.470
This long night will finally end...
